rked FK in each table and drawn on page 5. Views: page 6." style="fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="560" width="560" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rs1-v335" value="&lt;b&gt;Notation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary key (underlined) · &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; foreign key (italic) · &lt;b&gt;UQ&lt;/b&gt; UNIQUE&lt;br&gt;Crow's foot at the FK (child) table: &lt;i&gt;zero-or-many&lt;/i&gt;, or &lt;i&gt;zero-or-one&lt;/i&gt; when the FK is UNIQUE.&lt;br&gt;Double bar at the referenced (parent) table: &lt;i&gt;exactly one&lt;/i&gt; when the FK is NOT NULL; circle+bar: &lt;i&gt;zero-or-one&lt;/i&gt; when the FK is nullable.&lt;br&gt;No ON DELETE/ON UPDATE actions are declared (MySQL default: RESTRICT/NO ACTION). No engine is named in the DDL (MySQL 8 default: InnoDB); charset utf8mb4.&lt;br&gt;Source of truth: &lt;b&gt;app/schema.sql&lt;/b&gt;. Cross-row rules (unit equality, stock ≥ 0, farmer-only assignment) are enforced in app/db.py, not by SQL." style="fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F9A825;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="710" width="560" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="rs2" name="2 Reference data and users"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="rs2-v1" value="&lt;b&gt;Relational schema — page 2: reference data, users and farm assignment&lt;/b&gt; (exact SQL types, nullability, defaults and constraints)" style="fontFamily=Helvetica;text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=14;" vertex="